## Third-party data

The code and the authored content in this repository (curriculum topics,
frames, texts, lessons, and all other authored materials) are licensed under
the MIT License above.

Some values in `curriculum/lexicon/` are derived from third-party sources
distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0 and remain under that license, independently
of the MIT license on the surrounding code and authored content:

- `frequency_score` and `frequency_band` fields, derived from wordfreq 3.1.1
  frequency data (CC BY-SA 4.0).
- `source_refs` entries recording membership in the New General Service List
  (NGSL) 1.2 or the Business Service List (BSL) 1.2 (CC BY-SA 4.0).

See ATTRIBUTIONS.md for the full per-source attribution, license text link,
and indication of changes required by CC BY-SA 4.0.
